---
title: Blog
description: Essays, rants, reflections, and random brain droppings from Shira.
layout: layouts/page.njk
permalink: /blog/index.html
---
<h1>Blog</h1>
<p class="blog-intro">A personal blog. Random brain droppings, late-night projects, music, memory, and whatever else wanders through.</p>
{% set currentYear = "" %}
{% for post in collections.posts %}
  {% set postYear = post.date.getUTCFullYear() %}
  {% if postYear != currentYear %}
    {% if currentYear %}</ul>{% endif %}
    <h2 class="archive-year">{{ postYear }}</h2>
    <ul class="post-list archive-list">
    {% set currentYear = postYear %}
  {% endif %}
  <li class="archive-item">
    <a class="archive-link" href="{{ post.url }}">
      <time datetime="{{ post.date.toISOString() }}">{{ post.date | shortDate }}</time>
      <span>{{ post.data.title }}</span>
    </a>
  </li>
{% endfor %}
{% if collections.posts.length %}</ul>{% endif %}
